  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">어느 것이 무거울까요?</span></b><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">저울로 무게를 측정하면</span><br><b><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">다음 가~사 중 무거운 것부터 순서대로 나열 해주세요</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">( 가장 무거운 가사? ㅎㅎ )</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00b034a128abfd4e3c3f3531ecd35a45b39bb90d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00b034a128abfd4e3c3f3531ecd35a45b39bb90d\" data-origin-width=\"333\" data-origin-height=\"474\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">가. </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 300ml가 들어 있고 그 물속에 </span><b><span style=\"color: #F4D400;\">탁구공(크기30ml)</span></b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">를 비커 바닥에 실과 연결한다(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(실의 무게는 0이라고 가정한다, 탁구공은 물속에 완전 잠겨 있고, 물 중간에 있다)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c7b2a544dff5181a66e6c6bdd37b20b5c89e88a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c7b2a544dff5181a66e6c6bdd37b20b5c89e88a\" data-origin-width=\"328\" data-origin-height=\"434\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">나.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 300ml가 들어 있고 그 물속에 </span><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">쇠공(크기30ml)</span></b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">를 위쪽 실과 연결한다(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(실의 무게는 0이라고 가정한다, 쇠공은 물속에 완전 잠겨 있고, 물 중간에 있다)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f04f40b2246b66a7da0147bab1f40f93771957a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f04f40b2246b66a7da0147bab1f40f93771957a\" data-origin-width=\"325\" data-origin-height=\"426\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 300ml가 들어 있고 </span><b><span style=\"color: #F4D400;\">탁구공</span></b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 물에 떠 있다(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4040b0734ac9edb44d7993adedf2cbeb67633dc5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4040b0734ac9edb44d7993adedf2cbeb67633dc5\" data-origin-width=\"311\" data-origin-height=\"458\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">라.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 300ml가 들어 있고, 뜨는 </span><b><span style=\"color: #F4D400;\">탁구공</span></b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">을 막대기로 탁구공이 물에 완전 잠기도록 밀어 넣는다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(막대기는 물속에 들어가지 않는다, 탁구공만 물속에 딱 들어간다)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a24b53963df9358bf9f8e0982f6ccef48822d4e4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a24b53963df9358bf9f8e0982f6ccef48822d4e4\" data-origin-width=\"384\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">마.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 300ml가 들어 있고, </span><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">쇠공</span></b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 물속에 잠겨 가라앉아 있다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce08b212851b11c76b74b004770decd71abbba3b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce08b212851b11c76b74b004770decd71abbba3b\" data-origin-width=\"385\" data-origin-height=\"542\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 330ml가 들어 있다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(가,나,라.마 의 비커에 담긴 물의 높이와 같다)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29040b70fdd416661b5267e6aa55a8991d107eee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29040b70fdd416661b5267e6aa55a8991d107eee\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"469\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">비커에 물 300ml가 들어 있고, </span><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">쇠공</span></b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 위 실에 매달려 물속에 반 잠겨 있다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(위 그림 참고)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">정답은 아래 유튜브를 보시면 나옵니다 ^^</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">긱블( 해외에서 난리였던 저울 문제.. 교수님과 실험해봤습니다 (생각보다 어려움))</span><br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/HLCvbxvqsSs?si=E6mNveUaZg41dCax\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://youtu.be/HLCvbxvqsSs?si=E6mNveUaZg41dCax</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLCvbxvqsSs\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"855\" data-video-height=\"481\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qVmR0/hyZJlbdtmX/Jojn3NXQEuifrvKQm2Z2Zk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=208_296_356_456,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Lz6ys/hyZI7kBIG0/sR3Q7S1Va6raxmbH32mX31/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=208_296_356_456\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"855\" data-video-origin-height=\"481\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HLCvbxvqsSs\" width=\"855\" height=\"481\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
